    "Every one of these is a complete cook on its own. Add more only if you want to." : {

    },
    "Every row in this section has a verdict." : {

    },
    "Every sample since QA mode came on, oldest on the left. A staircase that never comes down is a leak; a ramp that flattens is a cache." : {

    },
    "Every send writes a folder per ticket — the report as Markdown, the screenshot, the mockup, and both handoff blocks — plus an index for the build and a timestamped copy of the QA log. With iCloud Drive on, it appears in Finder under iCloud Drive → Stocked → QA within a few seconds. With iCloud unavailable it is written on the phone instead, under On My iPhone → Stocked in the Files app, and syncs when iCloud returns." : {

    },
