    "Press and hold anywhere in the app to file a ticket. The screen, your last forty steps, whatever was running or stalled, recent failures, violated invariants, memory, thermal state, connectivity and a screenshot are attached automatically — you type one sentence. The HUD is read-only: memory, worst frame hitch, failures and open tickets. It cannot be tapped and never takes a touch from the app. Shake to report covers the places press-and-hold cannot reach — inside a scroll, a drag, or a text field, where the gesture is already taken." : {

